    <summary>A CLI application for interacting with a Cloudflare account, powered by cloudflare-go.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[flarectl is a command-line application for interacting with a Cloudflare account (zones, DNS records, firewall rules, users...). It is built from the `cmd/flarectl` folder of the v0 line of [cloudflare-go](https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-go).

## Usage

Authenticate with either an API Token or an API Key before running commands:

- API Token: set the `CF_API_TOKEN` environment variable.
- API Key: set the `CF_API_KEY` and `CF_API_EMAIL` environment variables.

Then run `flarectl --help` to list the available commands.

## Notes

- 64-bit Windows only. `flarectl.exe` is extracted to the package folder and made available on the PATH through a Chocolatey shim.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-go/blob/v0/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
